    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Error Code Mapping Reference\n\n## Roulette Errors\n\n| Error Code | Integer Value | Description | Notes |\n|------------|---------------|-------------|-------|\n| ROULETTE_NO_BALL_DETECT | 1 | No ball detected | - |\n| ROULETTE_NO_WIN_NUM | 2 | No winning number | - |\n| ROULETTE_NO_REACH_POS | 3 | No reach position | - |\n| ROULETTE_INVALID_AFTER_RELAUNCH | 4 | Invalid after relaunch | ARE.1 |\n| ROULETTE_SENSOR_STUCK | 5 | Sensor stuck | ARE.3 |\n| ROUELTTE_WRONG_BALL_DIR | 6 | Wrong ball direction | ARE.4 (typo in enum) |\n| ROULETTE_WRONG_WHEEL_DIR | 7 | Wrong wheel direction | - |\n| ROULETTE_LAUNCH_FAIL | 8 | Launch failed | ARE.2 |\n| ROULETTE_ENCODER_FAIL | 9 | Encoder failed | - |\n| ROULETTE_BALL_DROP_FAIL | 10 | Ball drop failed | - |\n| ROULETTE_COMPRESSOR_LEAK | 11 | Compressor leak | - |\n| ROULETTE_STUCK_NMB | 12 | Stuck number | - |\n| SENSOR_STUCK | 5 | Sensor stuck (alias) | Alias for ROULETTE_SENSOR_STUCK |\n| ROULETTE_RELAUNCH_FAILED | 13 | Relaunch failed | Custom error code |\n| BROADCAST_POST_EXCEPTION | 15 | Broadcast exception | Custom error code |\n\n## Sicbo Errors\n\n| Error Code | Integer Value | Description | Notes |\n|------------|---------------|-------------|-------|\n| SICBO_INVALID_RESULT | 20 | Invalid result | SBE.2 |\n| SICBO_NO_SHAKE | 21 | No shake | SBE.3 |\n| SICBO_INVALID_AFTER_RESHAKE | 22 | Invalid after reshake | SBE.1 |\n\n## Game Flow Errors\n\n| Error Code | Integer Value | Description | Notes |\n|------------|---------------|-------------|-------|\n| NO_START | 30 | No start | Used by both roulette and sicbo |\n| NO_BETSTOP | 31 | No betstop | Used by both roulette and sicbo |\n| NO_DEAL | 32 | No deal | Used by both roulette and sicbo |\n| NO_FINISH | 33 | No finish | Used by both roulette and sicbo |\n| JSON_PARSE_ERR | 34 | JSON parse error | Used by both roulette and sicbo |\n\n## 注意事項\n\n- **ROULETTE_RELAUNCH** 是成功通知，不是錯誤，因此不包含在 mapping 中\n- **SENSOR_STUCK** 是 **ROULETTE_SENSOR_STUCK** 的別名，兩者對應相同的整數值 (5)\n- 錯誤碼是大小寫敏感的",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "8.0.0",
      "title": "Error Code Mapping",
      "type": "text"
    },
